before:
Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>

enum State { READY = 1, DONE = 2 };
enum State finish(enum State s) {
 if (s == READY) { return DONE; }
 return s;
}
int main(void) {
 enum State s = READY;
 printf("%d\n", finish(s) == DONE);
}
```

